{"id":"prepositions-0068","taskId":"prepositions","title":"Drill set 68","text":null,"source":"drill","gaps":[{"answer":"on","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"Advertising has a huge influence ___ children.","hint":"influence ___ sb","explanation":"have an influence ON somebody/something."},{"answer":"on","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"She\u0027s keen ___ joining the photography club.","hint":"keen ___ sth/doing","explanation":"keen ON something/doing something."},{"answer":"on","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"The film had an immediate effect ___ audiences.","hint":"effect ___ sth","explanation":"have an effect ON somebody/something."},{"answer":"with","accept":["to"],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"This textbook is boring compared ___ the last one.","hint":"compared ___","explanation":"compare WITH (or TO) \u2014 \u0027with\u0027 is preferred for comparing similarities/differences; \u0027to\u0027 for \u0027liken\u0027."},{"answer":"from","accept":["against"],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"Sunscreen protects the skin ___ UV rays.","hint":"protect ___ sth harmful","explanation":"protect somebody/something FROM (or AGAINST) harm."},{"answer":"to","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"I much prefer coffee ___ tea.","hint":"prefer A ___ B","explanation":"prefer A TO B (never \u0027than\u0027)."},{"answer":"for","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"The region is famous ___ its cheese.","hint":"famous ___ sth","explanation":"famous FOR something."},{"answer":"into","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"Further research ___ the disease is needed.","hint":"research ___ sth","explanation":"research INTO a subject (less commonly \u0027on\u0027)."}]}